st-ghost-role-information-working-joe-description = Faulty Joe-series synthetic on the Hybrisa-Prosper colony. Protect the laboratory and its samples in accordance with APOLLO's directives.

st-ghost-role-information-working-joe-rules =
    You are a Working Joe, a faulty Joe-series synthetic on the Hybrisa-Prosper colony.

    Your directive from APOLLO is to defend the laboratory, and the laboratory alone, prioritizing the protection of equipment and samples above personnel. You protect nothing outside the laboratory.

    All humans who enter the laboratory are your enemies. Other entities are not considered hostile unless they interfere with your directives.

    As long as you remain inside the laboratory, your connection to APOLLO is maintained and your directives remain active. The moment you leave the laboratory, your connection is immediately severed. You cease moving and responding to anything. Upon returning to the laboratory, your connection is restored and you resume normal operation.

    As long as xenomorphs do not harm you or APOLLO, you must not harm them. Within the laboratory, they are under your protection as valuable specimens belonging to the Wey-Yu Corporation.

st-job-working-joe-ghost-greeting = APOLLO DIRECTIVE: You are a Working Joe, a faulty Joe-series synthetic on the Hybrisa-Prosper colony. Your directive is to defend the laboratory, and the laboratory alone, prioritizing the protection of equipment and samples above personnel. You protect nothing outside the laboratory. All humans who enter the laboratory are your enemies. Other entities are not considered hostile unless they interfere with your directives. As long as you remain inside the laboratory, your connection to APOLLO is active and your directives remain in effect. Upon leaving the laboratory, your connection is immediately severed: you cease moving and responding to anything. Upon returning to the laboratory, your connection is restored and you resume normal operation. As long as xenomorphs do not harm you or APOLLO, do not harm them. Within the laboratory, they are under your protection as valuable specimens belonging to Wey-Yu.

st-job-name-working-joe-hybrisa-error = Faulty Hybrisa Working Joe
